{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2021-09-02 09:30:00', 'title': 'ABBOTT EXPANDS PERIPHERAL VASCULAR OFFERINGS WITH ACQUISITION OF WALK VASCULAR, LLC', 'text': 'ABBOTT PARK, ILL., SEPT. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT)\xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ACQUIRED WALK VASCULAR, LLC,\xa0A COMMERCIAL-STAGE MEDICAL DEVICE COMPANY WITH A MINIMALLY INVASIVE MECHANICAL ASPIRATION THROMBECTOMY SYSTEM DESIGNED TO REMOVE PERIPHERAL BLOOD CLOTS.'}